ling bands singing about their experiences.<br /> This was added delight during my first Changeling chronicle, as it was set in San Diego, and SPG started off as a music and comedy busking group in the San Diego Zoo. And had fantastic official videos like <a href=\"http://https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=rldaQq458ao\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>, just to flaunt the Mask","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":425,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","user":"Seraph Kitty","date":". 04-19-2022, 05:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-22T12:42:12-07:00","id":1479312,"title":"","content":"I been thinking about adding some David Bowie songs to my Changeling music list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-22T12:50:01-07:00","id":1479314,"title":"","content":"I remember when this topic was discussed back in First Edition. Acts that were tossed around included Radiohead, Joanna Newsom, The Decemberists, CocoRosie, and Bj\u00f6rk. I used The Scary Jokes in the last little game I ran (Icicles and Catabolic Seed both have the feel of a changeling suffering Clarity damage to them, in my opinion).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-22T13:27:36-07:00","id":1479316,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1478870-what-music-groups-would-fit-changeling-the-lost?p=1479312#post1479312\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I been thinking about adding some David Bowie songs to my Changeling music list.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Scary Monsters album is probably a good place to start, as well as Diamond Dogs and the Labyrinth soundtrack. Also maybe Ziggy Stardust, Let's Dance, and/or the first Tin Machine album, depending on your tastes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-23T08:59:28-07:00","id":1479340,"title":"","content":"Scary Monsters and Diamond Dogs were excellent albums and Ziggy Stardust would fit well and for one of my elder elementals the Black Star album would be fitting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}